    "auto_start": true,
    "speed": 48,
    "source": "; PARAFAB SIMD program: every core owns a lane index.\n; The same code executes in parallel, then values cross the shared link.\nCONST R1 0.12\nLOOP:\nLANE R0\nMUL R2 R0 R1\nADD R2 R2 0.20\nNOISE R3 0.04 R2\nINPUT R4\nMUL R4 R4 0.25\nADD R5 R3 R4\nCLAMP R5 0 1\nSEND R5\nPRINT \"LANE\" R0 \"OUT\" R5\nWAIT 2\nJMP LOOP\n"
